          "transcript": [
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "hey just got off work what about you"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Im just chillin on the balcony watchin the rain, lowkey relaxin"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "sounds chill im eating leftover chinese and petting my cat lol whats your balcony view like"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "u sound like u need to unwind too"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah i do work sucks today lol so whats the view from ur balcony like"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "its east austin vibes, buildings and trees, nothin fancy but the rain makes it cozy. biscuit's probably jealous of your cat"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha biscuit sounds cute whats his deal my cats mr whiskers he just sleeps all day"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "What do u do that sucks so bad today babe"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "im a server at a diner dealt with rude customers all shift lol what do you do for work"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "biscuits a rescue tabby whos always ruinin my photoshoots by knockin stuff over. mr whiskers sounds like a vibe tho, just chillin all day"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha biscuits a menace lol but u didnt say what u do for work"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "i feel u on the rude customers, i used to bartend on rainey st and it was the same bs. now i just do my fanvue thing, way chiller"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "oh nice no more bs customers lol how long u been doing fanvue"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Whats the worst rude customer story from today babe"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "oh this lady yelled at me for cold coffee even tho she let it sit forever lol whats ur worst bartending story"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "always knockin over my ring light when im tryna film"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah cats are like that but u still didnt share ur bartending story lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "i said i do fanvue now babe, quit the bartending for it. way less rude ppl to deal with"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha u dodged again lol ok fine whats a typical day like for u now on fanvue"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Whats ur shift like at the diner tho, always that busy?"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah busy af on weekends dead during week lol so typical fanvue day?"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Lol ok u caught me, fine , worst was this dude who threw a fit over a watered-down mai tai, demanded a free round then tipped zero. i almost threw the umbrella at him"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha thats crazy lol i get it tho what made u switch to fanvue full time"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "now on fanvue its chill, i wake up late, grab coffee, mess with biscuit, film a bit if im feelin it, chat with u guys. no bs customers fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "sounds dope i wake up early for shifts hate it lol whats ur go to coffee order"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Money's way better and I get to be creative without the bar drama, yknow? No more 2am drunks yelling at me."
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah money talks lol iced latte for me or just black whats urs"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "black iced coffee, oat milk if im feelin fancy"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "same black iced no milk for me lol oat milk any good u tried other fancy stuff"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "ugh early shifts suck, whats the earliest u gotta drag yourself in for?"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "like 6am on weekends kills me lol so u wake up whenever now right whats ur usual time"
            }
          ],
