              "text": "im good, just had black iced coffee and now biscuit's trying to knock over my ring light again"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha biscuit thats funny my cat mittens does the same whats he look like"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Bored at work sounds like a drag fr, wish i could make your lunch break more interesting"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah work sucks you didnt say what biscuit looks like tho is he fluffy"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "he's this scruffy orange tabby with white paws, always knocking stuff over like he owns the place"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha scruffy orange tabby sounds cute mittens is all black and super lazy what do you do for work"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Lol mittens sounds chaotic too"
            },
            {
