              "text": "haha yeah chaotic in a lazy way but what do you do for work you didnt say"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Whats got u so bored at work today tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha im just doing data entry all day its mind numbing what about your job you keep dodging lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "aw black cats are lowkey the vibe, super lazy sounds like my kinda pet"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah black cats are cool but you still dodging my question about your job lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "I do content on here full time now, quit bartending a while back. what do u do thats got u bored at work"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha im in accounting data entry all day super dull what was bartending like"
            },
            {
