              "text": "Sounds like data entry is killing u tho, whats the worst part about it"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah the repetition is the worst just endless typing but seriously what was bartending like"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Lol bartending was chaotic fun, slingin drinks at this tiki spot til 2am, but the tips were solid when ppl werent bein asses"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha chaotic tiki spot sounds fun did you have any crazy customer stories"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Whats the most mind-numbing part of ur data entry day tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha youre dodging again lol tell me a crazy customer story"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Oh man, one night this dude tried to order a mai tai with like five extra shots, ended up dancing on the bar til security dragged him out. Wild times lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha thats wild lol ever have anyone famous come in or just drunks"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "U got any crazy stories from ur accounting gigs? Like someone messin up the numbers big time?"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha not really crazy but one guy entered a million dollar error got fired fast what about famous ppl at your bar"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lowkey had a couple local musicians swing by, but mostly just rowdy drunks tryin to impress"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha local musicians sound cool any i might know or just small timers"
            },
            {
